//! **Repairing a false premise.**
//!
//! The faithful-loop soundness chain carries a blanket iota hypothesis
//! quantified over EVERY pre-pass function `w`, with no constraint:
//!
//! ```text
//! forall (w : KExpr -> OptionType KExpr) (g x r : KExpr),
//!   iota_reduct_whc3 (red_rec the_red_env) w (app g x) = wstep r
//!   -> par_reduces_cd_star the_red_env (app g x) r
//! ```
//!
//! **That premise is false.** `iota_reduct_whc3` feeds `w major` to its level-4
//! bind and then builds the reduct from `kapp_args wmajor` — the *reduced*
//! major's arguments. `major` appears nowhere in the reduct. So a `w` returning
//! an unrelated constructor application passes the head-name and rule lookups
//! and emits a reduct assembled from the wrong fields; on the real environment
//! it yields `DefEq (Nat.rec s0 s0 s0 s0) (Sort 0)`.
//!
//! Everything carrying it was vacuous — and not only on the completeness side:
//! `def_eq_fuel_wh_sound`, the faithful algorithm's *soundness*, carries it too.
//!
//! # The repair
//!
//! Constrain `w` to be sound: if it returns, it reduces. The tree already wanted
//! this in two places — `defeq_of_prepass_iota` takes exactly
//! `(hdm : DefEq major wmajor)`, and `iota_reduct_whc_some_inv` already hands
//! back exactly the equation that side condition consumes. The blanket premise
//! was the **one** place in the chain where the link between `major` and
//! `wmajor` was dropped.
//!
//! # Why it costs nothing where it is used
//!
//! `w` is only ever instantiated once in the whole development — at the loop,
//! `fun e3 => whnf_fuel_red_wh3 the_red_env k e3` — and there the required proof
//! is the `Nat.rec` induction hypothesis already in scope. `hw := ih`, literally.
//!
//! This is the mutual recursion `wh_soundness.rs` calls "better made explicit
//! than hidden inside a proof term". The unconstrained shape does not make it
//! explicit; it *erases* it, and erasing it is what made the premise false.
//!
//! # Status after the repair
//!
//! Still a hypothesis, **not** discharged — but a satisfiable one, satisfied by
//! the instance that matters rather than only vacuously. A discharge needs two
//! things that are partially built: the positional obligation that the surviving
//! lookups fire a plain iota on the swapped spine (`whc_fires_plain_minimal`
//! covers minimal spines only), and lifting the major's reduction to the whole
//! spine at arbitrary depth (`par_reduces_cd_star_app` covers depth one).
//!
//! `DerivedProved`, empty axiom closures.

use crate::spec::error::SpecError;
use crate::spec::Specification;

impl Specification {
    /// The soundness chain and capstone, over a constrained pre-pass.
    pub(super) fn add_wh3_hiota_repair(&mut self) -> Result<(), SpecError> {
        self.add_recursive_def(
            SRC_REDUCE_APP_HEAD_WH3_PAR_HW,
            "reduce_app_head_wh3_par_hw: the application-head step reduces parallel-wise — with the pre-pass CONSTRAINED to be sound. \\
\\
The unconstrained version is unsound as a hypothesis, and this is the repair. Eight of the nine head arms appeal to hiota3; each now passes hw alongside wh, so the appeal is only available for a pre-pass that actually reduces. DerivedProved, zero axiom_deps.",
        )?;
        self.add_recursive_def(
            SRC_REDUCE_ONCE_RED_WH3_PAR_HW,
            "reduce_once_red_wh3_par_hw: one three-way step is a par_reduces_cd_star reduction, with the pre-pass constrained to be sound. Threads hw through to the application head. DerivedProved, zero axiom_deps.",
        )?;
        self.add_recursive_def(
            SRC_WHNF_FUEL_RED_WH3_PAR_HW,
            "whnf_fuel_red_wh3_par_hw: the whole three-way loop is a par_reduces_cd_star reduction. \\
\\
THIS IS WHERE THE REPAIR PAYS FOR ITSELF. The loop is the ONLY place the pre-pass is ever chosen, and at that single site the required soundness proof is the Nat.rec induction hypothesis already in scope: hw := ih, literally, up to one beta step. So constraining the hypothesis costs nothing where it is used, and excludes exactly the pre-passes that made the unconstrained form false. \\
\\
This is the mutual recursion wh_soundness.rs describes as better made explicit than hidden in a proof term. The unconstrained shape does not make it explicit — it ERASES it, and erasing it is what made the premise false. DerivedProved, zero axiom_deps.",
        )?;
        self.add_recursive_def(
            SRC_DEF_EQ_WHNF_JOIN_WH3_HW,
            "def_eq_whnf_join_wh3_hw: joinability of the two three-way whnf results, over the constrained ι residual. Same derivation as def_eq_whnf_join_wh3 with hiotap3 retyped and both legs routed through the repaired par leg. DerivedProved, zero axiom_deps.",
        )?;
        self.add_recursive_def(
            SRC_DEF_EQ_FUEL_COMPLETE_WH3_NA_HW,
            "def_eq_fuel_complete_wh3_na_hw: THE CAPSTONE, over a residual that is not false. \\
\\
Its predecessors carry a blanket ι hypothesis quantified over EVERY pre-pass function, with no constraint. That premise is FALSE: iota_reduct_whc3 builds its reduct from kapp_args wmajor, so a pre-pass returning an unrelated constructor application fires the rule with the wrong constructor's fields and emits a reduct the term does not reduce to. Concretely it yields DefEq (Nat.rec s0 s0 s0 s0) (Sort 0). Everything carrying it was vacuous — including, note, the faithful algorithm's SOUNDNESS, not only its completeness. \\
\\
Here the pre-pass must itself reduce, which is the true statement of pre-pass soundness and is exactly what the tree already wanted in two places: defeq_of_prepass_iota takes (hdm : DefEq major wmajor), and iota_reduct_whc_some_inv already returns the equation that side condition consumes. The blanket premise was the ONE place in the chain where the link between major and wmajor was dropped. \\
\\
STILL A HYPOTHESIS, NOT DISCHARGED — but now a satisfiable one, and satisfiable at the instance that matters rather than only vacuously: the loop itself satisfies it, witnessed by ih. What remains for a discharge is the positional obligation that the surviving lookups fire a plain iota on the swapped spine (whc_fires_plain_minimal covers minimal spines only), and lifting the major's reduction to the whole spine at arbitrary depth (par_reduces_cd_star_app covers depth one). \\
\\
SCOPE unchanged: complete against DefEq, which has no eta, no proof irrelevance, no structure-eta, no universe conversion and no literal computation — all of which the shipping is_def_eq implements. DerivedProved, zero axiom_deps.",
        )?;
        self.add_recursive_def(
            SRC_DEF_EQ_FUEL_COMPLETE_WH3_AT_THE_RED_ENV_NA_HW,
            "def_eq_fuel_complete_wh3_at_the_red_env_na_hw: the repaired capstone with i1..i8 discharged positionally. Premises: the constrained hiotap3, hnf3, and one Wh3NormAcc. DerivedProved, zero axiom_deps.",
        )?;
        Ok(())
    }
}

